Xiosov
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 10 DEAL OSUH
OSUH 9 FACE_ALL
OSUH 7 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE OSUH OSUH
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank ascending
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS, SPADES, HEARTS}
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DEST Size == 2
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Empty
$win
PILE ALL OSUH Empty
